{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>Therefore He knows their works</b> — it is לעֲבֹדֵיהֶם (their works), like: וַעֲבֹדָיו בְּיַד הָאֱלֹהִים (and their works are in the hand of Elohim)." "<b>Therefore He overturns night</b> — He turns their light into night."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {0 "Resolved the second comparison as Job 10:7 based on the phrase ועבדיו ביד האלהים."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:29.604238017Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}